==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Zoge]]s spawn, delay 3.33~10 seconds<sup>100f~300f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Znache]]s spawn after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>, delay 3.33~10 seconds<sup>100f~300f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Those Guys]]s spawn after 60 seconds<sup>1,800f</sup>, delay 3.33~10 seconds<sup>100f~300f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Zroco]]s spawn after 80 seconds<sup>2,400f</sup>, delay 3.33~10 seconds<sup>100f~300f</sup>.
*Infinite [[B.B.Bunny|B.B.Bunnies]] spawn after 93.33 seconds<sup>2,800f</sup>, delay 3.33~13.33 seconds<sup>100f~400f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Baa Baa]]s spawn after 93.33 seconds<sup>2,800f</sup>, delay 3.33~20 seconds<sup>100f~600f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Zomboe]]s spawn after 86.67 seconds<sup>2,600f</sup>, delay 20~40 seconds<sup>600f~1,200f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Zigge]]s spawn after 86.67 seconds<sup>2,600f</sup>, delay 20~40 seconds<sup>600f~1,200f</sup>.
*1 [[Le'boin]] spawns after 93.33 seconds<sup>2,800f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Le'boin]]s spawn after 233.33 seconds<sup>7,000f</sup>, delay 133.33~200 seconds<sup>4,000f~6,000f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Le'boin]] spawns.

==Strategy==
Rushing this stage is very easy and should be done to avoid having more [[:Category:Zombie Enemies|Zombies]] to deal with. Although, it is a little bit harder to rush the stage than normal due to the first Le'boin now appearing at ~93 seconds. Never fear, as [[Titan Cat (Normal Cat)|Mythical Titan Cat]] should still be able to deal with the Le'boin. Once the Le'boin has been dealt with, you will have to fight B.B.Bunny, Baa Baa, Zomboe and Zigge to get to the base. This is not typically hard, just time-consuming.

